id: CTB-SRC0028-dec017
source: SRC-0028
section: §0.3
kind: requirement
extends: LXM-REQ-000216
decision: LXM-DEC-000017
text: By owner decision LXM-DEC-000017, the Master session may write once, on 2026-10-31, as new branches pushed from a fresh clone outside iCloud; it never writes the integration branch and never force-pushes.
